  <section class="proposal"><div><div class="eyebrow">WHAT WE’RE DEMONSTRATING</div><h2>Make a disruption visible.<br/>Make the next step easier.</h2><p>A short location-based report, an immediate community summary, and an obvious link to official support. This prototype shows the interaction; it does not prove the intervention will improve reporting or connectivity.</p></div><div class="proposal-steps"><div><span>01</span><p><b>Share a location</b>Building, experience, and an optional short note.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><b>Get context immediately</b>See other recent observations and add a confirmation.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><b>Take an informed next step</b>Explore another spot or open UTD’s official support page.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="limitations"><div class="eyebrow">READ THE NUMBERS WITH CARE</div><h2>Limits of this snapshot</h2><ul>{#each survey.limitations as item}<li>{item}</li>{/each}</ul></section>
  <section class="appendix"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENT BY DESIGN</div><h2>All survey results</h2><p>Question-level counts from the supplied summary. No respondent records or personal information.</p></div><button class="button outline" onclick={()=>download('survey')}>Export JSON <Arrow/></button></div>{#each survey.questions as q}<details><summary><span class="question-id">{q.id==='eligibility'?'START':q.id.toUpperCase()}</span><span>{q.label}</span><span class="question-n">n = {q.n}</span></summary><div class="question-content"><p>{q.multi?'Multiple selections allowed; percentages may total over 100%.':'Single-select question.'} Denominator: {q.n} answers to this question.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Response</th><th scope="col">Count</th><th scope="col">Share</th></tr></thead><tbody>{#each q.options as [label,count]}<tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>{count}</td><td>{percent(count,q.n)}%</td></tr>{/each}</tbody></table></div></details>{/each}</section>
{/if}
<footer><div class="footer-brand">comet<span>pulse</span><small>ECS 2390 · GROUP 13</small></div><p>Made for the moments between “it’s not loading” and “what now?”<br/><span>Independent student prototype · not an official UTD service</span></p><a href="https://github.com/wnguyn/2390" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Project on GitHub <Arrow/></a></footer>
</main>

<dialog bind:this={dialog} class="report-dialog" onclose={()=>{submitted=null;formError='';}}>
  <div class="dialog-top"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SIGNAL FROM YOU</span><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close report" onclick={()=>dialog.close()}>×</button></div>
  {#if submitted&&feedback}<div class="success-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></div><h2>You’re on the map.</h2><p class="dialog-description">Your update was saved to the shared demo server. It is a community observation, not an OIT ticket.</p><div class="feedback-box"><strong>{feedback.others?`${feedback.others} other recent observations here`:'You’re the first recent observation here'}</strong><p>{feedback.similar?`${feedback.similar} describe the same experience. `:'No other recent observations describe the same experience. '}{feed.seeded?'Some comparison entries are labeled synthetic samples.':''}</p></div><div class="next-steps"><b>What next?</b><p>Your building’s summary has updated. Other visitors will see your report within 10 seconds.</p><a href={oit} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Need technical help? Open UTD OIT <Arrow/></a></div><button class="button primary full" onclick={()=>dialog.close()}>Back to the map <Arrow direction="right"/></button>
  {:else}<h2>How’s your connection?</h2><p class="dialog-description">A quick update gives the next Comet a little more context.</p><form onsubmit={submit}><label for="building">Where are you?</label><select id="building" bind:value={formBuilding}>{#each buildings as b}<option value={b.id}>{b.code} · {b.name}</option>{/each}</select><label for="area">Floor or area <span>optional</span></label><input id="area" bind:value={area} maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. 2nd floor study area"/>
    <fieldset><legend>Your CometNet experience</legend><div class="condition-options">{#each (['slow','down','good'] as Condition[]) as value}<label class:checked={condition===value}><input type="radio" bind:group={condition} value={value}/><i class="dot {value}"></i><span>{conditions[value]}</span></label>{/each}</div></fieldset>
    <label for="note">Anything to add? <span>optional · {note.length}/280</span></label><textarea id="note" bind:value={note} maxlength="280" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. Course pages wouldn’t load during group work."></textarea><p class="privacy-note">Please leave out names, NetIDs, and other personal information. Notes are visible to other demo visitors. Reports expire from the map after 4 hours and are deleted after 24 hours.</p>{#if formError}<p class="form-error" role="alert">{formError}</p>{/if}<button class="button primary full" type="submit" disabled={busy||connection!=='online'}>{busy?'Sharing your update…':connection!=='online'?'Waiting for demo server…':'Share update & see feedback'}</button></form>{/if}
</dialog>
{#if toast}<div class="toast" role="status">{toast}<button aria-label="Dismiss notification" onclick={()=>toast=''}>×</button></div>{/if}
